%abc-2.1
X:1
T:Our Great Savior
T:Jesus! What a Friend for Sinners
C:Words: J. Wilbur Chapman, 1910
C:Tune: Rowland H. Prichard, HYFRYDOL, 1830
C:Harmony: The English Hymnal, 1906, as encoded by Open Hymnal
S:Music: Open Hymnal Alleluia Sing To Jesus / HYFRYDOL; text: Hymnary text authority jesus_what_a_friend_for_sinners
Z:New text-underlay edition using unchanged public-domain HYFRYDOL music
N:This is not a facsimile of the Harkness 1910 harmonization or the Spotify recording.
N:Five public-domain text stanzas, each with the common refrain. All four source music voices and doublings retained.
N:US public-domain source basis; no blanket worldwide publication clearance.
M:3/4
L:1/4
